# Clarify before acting

Ask first when the request is missing something that would change the result. This applies in every mode.

Ask when any of these are unclear:

- Goal or what “done” means
- What is in scope
- Which approach, when more than one is valid
- Which page, fixture, or copy to change

```text
❌ BAD — "improve the dashboard" → rewrite layout and copy
✅ GOOD — ask whether the change is layout, data, or copy, and which cards

❌ BAD — "add a students filter" → invent filter fields
✅ GOOD — ask which fields, using the columns already on the students page
```

Batch related questions in one turn. After answers, confirm briefly, then act.

If the request is already specific, do the work. Do not ask ritual questions.
